---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import profile from '../../content/assets/profile.webp';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
    title="About"
    description="Matt Nelson's path from comparative literature to leading engineering for Panorama."
>
    <div class="prose">
        <h1>About</h1>
        <Image
            class="portrait"
            src={profile}
            width={320}
            alt="Me smiling in front of a bookcase."
        />
        <p class="lede">
            I'm a software engineering manager in Providence, Rhode Island.
        </p>
        <p>
            I lead the team behind <a href="https://panorama.ag">Panorama</a>,
            Precision Planting's cloud platform for farm data. Growers and
            dealers use it to see what their equipment is doing, plan what that
            equipment does next, and ask Aurora, its AI agent, questions about
            their operations. My team of about ten works across web, mobile,
            cloud, and C++ data services. I also help set the product's
            direction, so I spend a lot of my time with the people who use it.
        </p>
        <p>
            I joined Precision Planting in 2021 and became the platform's first
            web developer in 2022, then its technical lead through its launches
            in 2023 and 2024. I've led the team since late 2024, and I still
            build core systems myself.
        </p>
        <h2>A winding road to software</h2>
        <p>
            I came to engineering from the humanities. I earned a PhD in
            comparative literature at the University of Illinois at
            Urbana-Champaign, and I{' '}
            <a href="/research">
                wrote about modern Sanskrit and postcolonial poetry
            </a>{' '}
            and <a href="/teaching">taught literature, writing, and Sanskrit</a>
            . A film-studies research project moved me toward software. I built
            the database and web app that replaced its spreadsheets, and then I
            kept going.
        </p>
        <p>
            I had no background in agriculture when I started, and growers have
            taught me most of what I now know about it.
        </p>
        <h2>Talks and interviews</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <a href="https://youtu.be/boRfHaKV4gM">
                    Precision Planting Winter Conference 2025
                </a>
            </li>
            <li>
                <a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/4hedpDFFDnd6uf5wqTyGtg">
                    "Building Confidence in Aurora"
                </a>
                , on the podcast <em>Smarter Every Season</em>
            </li>
            <li>
                <a href="https://www.producer.com/crops/panorama-from-precision-planting-offers-mobile-access-to-data/">
                    Interview in <em>The Western Producer</em>
                </a>
                , 2025
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</Base>

<style>
    .portrait {
        width: 9rem;
        margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    }
    @media (min-width: 36rem) {
        .portrait {
            float: right;
            width: 11rem;
            margin: 0.35rem 0 1rem 2rem;
        }
    }
</style>
